      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, you got me",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C00200079006F007500200067006F00740020006D00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "People always think that, but no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065006F0070006C006500200061006C00770061007900730020007400680069006E006B00200074006800610074002C00200062007500740020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I knew I recognized you.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E00650077002000490020007200650063006F0067006E0069007A0065006400200079006F0075002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, no need to be shy. I understand all too well\nthe burden of fame. Your secret is safe with me.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder if I could trouble a renowned Trainer\nsuch as yourself with a trifling request.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I am an auteur, you see—a writer of great novels.\nNot that my talent is appreciated by the masses...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut I’ve got just the idea for my next manuscript!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The only element I lack is the dramatis personae.\nA famed Trainer like you could round out my cast<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand provide the inspiration I’ve been looking for.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I have an idea for the Pokémon my tale shall\nrequire. Could you assemble them for me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First, we must have a Ground-type Pokémon.\nNext, a Pokémon that knows Flamethrower.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nFinally, a Pokémon bearing a Mega Stone!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I must see all three! Then my creative juices will\nsurely runneth over.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCould you put the trio in your party and come\nshow me? I can repeat my list whenever you like.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 174
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you brought to me the Pokémon three\nrequired for my tale?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200079006F0075002000620072006F007500670068007400200074006F0020006D0065002000740068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000740068007200650065000A0072006500710075006900720065006400200066006F00720020006D0079002000740061006C0065003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve brought them",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049201900760065002000620072006F00750067006800740020007400680065006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me your list again",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D006500200079006F007500720020006C00690073007400200061006700610069006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not quite yet...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007100750069007400650020007900650074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What follows are the Pokémon three I need to see.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200066006F006C006C006F007700730020006100720065002000740068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000740068007200650065002000490020006E00650065006400200074006F0020007300650065002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First, a Ground-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069007200730074002C00200061002000470072006F0075006E0064002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Second, a Pokémon that knows Flamethrower.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650063006F006E0064002C0020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000740068006100740020006B006E006F0077007300200046006C0061006D0065007400680072006F007700650072002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And finally, a Pokémon bearing a Mega Stone.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000660069006E0061006C006C0079002C0020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000620065006100720069006E0067002000610020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E0065002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I must see all three if I’m to write my great novel.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCould you put the Pokémon I need in your party\nand come show me? I can repeat my list anytime.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You haven’t even got three Pokémon! I can’t\npossibly write my story if I haven’t seen all three.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nDo you think I just make this stuff up?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It seems you have the requisite number of\nPokémon, at least. But will they fit the bill?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First things first. Which is your Ground-type\nPokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600690072007300740020007400680069006E00670073002000660069007200730074002E00200057006800690063006800200069007300200079006F00750072002000470072006F0075006E0064002D0074007900700065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>",
