    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Never mind",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650076006500720020006D0069006E00640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wish for you to show me a GROUND-type\nPokémon. I feel I’ve been quite clear on this point.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ጃ<U+0008><U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0008>! Quite the choice. Oh\nyes,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthis<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nis<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsparking<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsome<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nideas...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 22,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then on to our next character. Which is the\nPokémon that knows the move Flamethrower?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want you to show me a Pokémon that knows the\nmove Flamethrower. Don’t disappoint me.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Yes! <U+0010><U+0003>ጃ\t<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ā\t! The scenes are\ncoming<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsharp<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfocus<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnow!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We need a strong finish! Which is the Pokémon\nthat bears a mighty Mega Stone?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, you must show me a Pokémon that is\nholding a Mega Stone!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002C00200079006F00750020006D007500730074002000730068006F00770020006D00650020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200074006800610074002000690073000A0068006F006C00640069006E0067002000610020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E0065002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ጃ\n<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ā\n! Astounding! I never\nwould<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhave<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthought—!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThank you, friend. You’ve given me precisely what\nI asked for, so now I can craft my great tale.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 166
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is to be an adventure novel, you see.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSince you’ve been so integral to the whole thing,\nI don’t mind giving you a little preview of the plot.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our tale begins deep in the wilds of the Kalos\nregion...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750072002000740061006C006500200062006500670069006E00730020006400650065007000200069006E0020007400680065002000770069006C006400730020006F006600200074006800650020004B0061006C006F0073000A0072006500670069006F006E002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>There, in a forest replete with nature’s majesty,\na Pokémon called <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthought...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n“I wish that I could Mega Evolve.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>And so our hero journeys forth in search of a\nMega Stone, Trainer <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nby<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntheir side.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They arrive at the Tower of Mastery, where they\nmeet...<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBearing the very same Mega Stone they sought,\nno less!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“Defeat me in true battle,” their foe declares, “and I\nshall allow you to take this Mega Stone with you.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Accepting the challenge,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsends<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nout<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbattle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 23,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Just then, another rival for the stone swoops in\nout of nowhere!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003> unleashes\nFlamethrower<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbid<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nclaim<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMega<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nStone<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor itself!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 176
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> leaps in front of\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nprotect<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nit<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfrom<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nFlamethrower...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
